    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Google Meet \u2014 SD-WAN Kernel Quality (UDP Media Stream)",
      "description": "FortiGate SD-WAN kernel latency, jitter, and packet loss for Google Meet UDP media stream (appid 37402). SOURCE: VictoriaMetrics metrics 'fortigate_sdwan_sla_latency', 'fortigate_sdwan_sla_jitter', 'fortigate_sdwan_sla_packetloss', label app=Google_Chat_Video_Call. Derived from Elasticsearch index 'logs-fortinet_fortigate.log-*', fields: 'fortinet.firewall.latency', 'fortinet.firewall.jitter', 'fortinet.firewall.packetloss'. Original FortiGate log: logid=0113022941, type=event, subtype=sdwan, appid=37402. Ingested by Elastic Agent Fortinet integration v1.36.8. IMPORTANT: This metric appears intermittently. FortiGate only generates kernel SLA metrics for UDP flows when it has sufficient packet samples for RTT estimation. Panel will show No data between active calls. When present, this is the most direct transport-layer measurement of the actual media stream available from this hardware without endpoint agents.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "P4169E866C3094E38"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Latency (ms)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "#37872D",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Jitter (ms)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "#E0B400",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Packet Loss (%)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
